        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Fix Ollama hourly usage cadence",
        "body": "## Summary\n- map Ollama Hourly usage to a 60-minute primary quota window\n- preserve the existing five-hour Session usage mapping\n- document both primary quota labels\n\n## Proof\nCurrent main parses the existing Hourly usage fixture but returns a nil cadence. This branch runs that same parser path and proves both `snapshot.sessionWindowMinutes == 60` and `usage.primary.windowMinutes == 60`; all 9 focused parser tests pass.\n\nNo live account or browser-cookie probe was run: AGENTS.md requires parser fixtures for this behavior unless live provider access is explicitly requested, and this avoids any Keychain prompt.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageParserTests` (9 passed)\n- changed Swift files: SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict passed\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- 3 focused commits: implementation, tests, documentation",
